// RFC 0016 K4 "Families match ports": LightmappedGeneric in the combos the
// core's `lightmapped` family claims (base texture, the flat lightmap, $color,
// vertex color and alpha, $alpha, alpha test and translucency). The legacy
// port draws them (run with --extra-arg=-vklegacylightmapped; its pixels are
// judged against the retail D3D9 bytecode) and records the port pixels the
// family suite compares with (tools/render/family_port_pixels.py). Quads are in
// clip space (identity transforms). Bump, detail, env maps and two base
// textures are not claimed by the family yet; their cases stay in
// ../forced/lightmappedgeneric_native_combos.vdf.
